omato + \" tomato, \" + this.bag.carrot + \" carrot, \" + this.bag.fish + \" fish\";\n    this.bag.tomato = 0;\n    this.bag.carrot = 0;\n    this.bag.fish = 0;\n    this.playClick();\n    this.setDialogueText(\"Sold \" + sold + \" for \" + earned + \"c. Coins: \" + this.coins + \".\");\n  }\n  // --- NPC + quest -----------------------------------------------------------\n  talkToMira() {\n    if (this.quest === \"none\") {\n      this.quest = \"active\";\n      this.showDialogue(\n        'Mira: \"Morning! The village feast needs tomatoes.\\nBring me 3 tomatoes and I will pay you 50c.\"'\n      );\n    } else if (this.quest === \"active\") {\n      if (this.bag.tomato >= 3) {\n        this.bag.tomato -= 3;\n        this.coins += QUEST_REWARD;\n        this.quest = \"done\";\n        this.playClick();\n        this.showDialogue(\n          'Mira: \"Three perfect tomatoes! Thank you!\"\\nQuest complete \\u2014 +' + QUEST_REWARD + \"c. Coins: \" + this.coins + \".\"\n        );\n      } else {\n        this.showDialogue(\n          'Mira: \"I still need 3 tomatoes for the feast.\\nYou have ' + this.bag.tomato + ' in your bag.\"'\n        );\n      }\n    } else {\n      this.showDialogue('Mira: \"Thanks again for the tomatoes. The feast will be lovely!\"');\n    }\n  }\n  // --- fishing ---------------------------------------------------------------\n  startFishing() {\n    this.fishing = true;\n    this.fishMarker = 0;\n    this.fishDir = 1;\n    this.eventBus.emit(\"hv:freeze\", { frozen: true });\n    this.showFishingBar();\n    this.showDialogue(\"Fishing! Press E when the marker is in the green zone.\");\n  }\n  tryCatchFish() {\n    this.fishing = false;\n    this.eventBus.emit(\"hv:freeze\", { frozen: false });\n    this.hideFishingBar();\n    if (this.fishMarker >= FISH_ZONE[0] && this.fishMarker <= FISH_ZONE[1]) {\n      this.bag.fish += 1;\n      this.playClick();\n      this.showDialogue(\"Caught a fish! Fish in bag: \" + this.bag.fish + \" (sell: 15c).\");\n    } else {\n      this.showDialogue(\"It got away... the marker was outside the green zone.\");\n    }\n  }\n  // --- sleep / save / load -----------------------------------------------------\n  sleep() {\n    for (const plot of this.plots) {\n      if (plot.state === \"planted\" && plot.watered && plot.stage < 2) {\n        plot.stage += 1;\n        plot.timer = 0;\n        this.setCropSprite(plot);\n      }\n      plot.watered = false;\n      if (plot.state === \"planted\") this.setPlotTile(plot, 60 + plot.col % 3);\n    }\n    this.day += 1;\n    this.minutes = DAY_START_MINUTES;\n    const player = this.findEntityByName(\"Player\");\n    if (player !== void 0) this.setPositionFor(player, 4, 1);\n    const save = this.serialize();\n    const engine = this._engine;\n    if (engine) engine.__hvSave = save;\n    this.eventBus.emit(\"hv:save\", { save });\n    this.showDialogue(\"Day \" + this.day + \" \\u2014 you wake up rested. Game saved.\");\n  }\n  setPositionFor(entity, x, y) {\n    const t = this.getComponent(entity, \"transform\");\n    if (t) {\n      t.x = x;\n      t.y = y;\n    }\n    this.physics.teleport(entity, x, y);\n  }\n  serialize() {\n    return JSON.stringify({\n      version: 1,\n      day: this.day,\n      minutes: Math.round(this.minutes),\n      coins: this.coins,\n      seeds: this.seeds,\n      bag: this.bag,\n      quest: this.quest,\n      tool: this.tool,\n      seedType: this.seedType,\n      plots: this.plots.map((p) => ({\n        col: p.col,\n        row: p.row,\n        state: p.state,\n        crop: p.crop,\n        stage: p.stage,\n        watered: p.watered,\n        timer: p.timer\n      })),\n      player: (() => {\n        const player = this.findEntityByName(\"Player\");\n        if (player === void 0) return null;\n        const t = this.getComponent(player, \"transform\");\n        return t ? { x: t.x, y: t.y } : null;\n      })()\n    });\n  }\n  /** Host save-bridge entry point: apply a save loaded from IndexedDB\n   * after onStart (the read is async). Refreshes the HUD and greets the\n   * player. Called by the runtime SaveBridge; never call from a script. */\n  restoreFromSave(save) {\n    this.restore(save);\n    this.updateHud();\n    this.showDialogue(\"Welcome back to Harvest Valley! Day \" + this.day + \".\");\n  }\n  restore(json) {\n    const data = JSON.parse(json);\n    this.day = data.day ?? 1;\n    this.minutes = data.minutes ?? DAY_START_MINUTES;\n    this.coins = data.coins ?? 20;\n    this.seeds = { tomato: 2, carrot: 0, ...data.seeds ?? {} };\n    this.bag = { tomato: 0, carrot: 0, fish: 0, ...data.bag ?? {} };\n    this.quest = data.quest ?? \"none\";\n    this.tool = data.tool ?? \"hoe\";\n    this.seedType = data.seedType ?? \"tomato\";\n    for (const plot of this.plots) {\n      if (plot.sprite !== -1) {\n        this.destroyEntity(plot.sprite);\n        plot.sprite = -1;\n      }\n    }\n    for (const saved of data.plots ?? []) {\n      const plot = this.plots.find((p) => p.col === saved.col && p.row === saved.row);\n      if (!plot) continue;\n      plot.state = saved.state;\n      plot.crop = saved.crop ?? \"\";\n      plot.stage = saved.stage ?? 0;\n      plot.watered = !!saved.watered;\n      plot.timer = saved.timer ?? 0;\n      if (plot.state === \"grass\") {\n        this.setPlotTile(plot, -1);\n      } else if (plot.state === \"tilled\") {\n        this.setPlotTile(plot, 60 + plot.col % 3);\n      } else {\n        this.setPlotTile(plot, plot.watered ? 48 : 60 + plot.col % 3);\n        plot.sprite = this.spawn(\"Crop-\" + plot.col + \"-\" + plot.row, {\n          transform: { x: plot.x, y: plot.y, rotation: 0, scaleX: 1, scaleY: 1 },\n          sprite: {\n            textureId: \"farm-atlas-tex\",\n            width: 0.9,\n            height: 0.9,\n            pivotX: 0.5,\n            pivotY: 0.5,\n            region: \"grass\"\n          },\n          sortingLayer: { layer: 1, orderInLayer: 0, ySort: true }\n        });\n        this.setCropSprite(plot);\n      }\n    }\n    if (data.player) {\n      const player = this.findEntityByName(\"Player\");\n      if (player !== void 0) this.setPositionFor(player, data.player.x, data.player.y);\n    }\n  }\n  // --- HUD / dialogue / fishing bar -------------------------------------------\n  clockText() {\n    const total = Math.floor(this.minutes);\n    const hh = Math.floor(total / 60);\n    const mm = total % 60;\n    const pad = (n) => n < 10 ? \"0\" + n : \"\" + n;\n    return \"Day \" + this.day + \"  \" + pad(hh) + \":\" + pad(mm);\n  }\n  setLabel(name, text) {\n    const e = this.findEntityByName(name);\n    if (e === void 0) return;\n    const label = this.getComponent(e, \"uiLabel\");\n    if (label) label.text = text;\n  }\n  setUiOffsetY(name, y) {\n    const e = this.findEntityByName(name);\n    if (e === void 0) return;\n    const t = this.getComponent(e, \"uiTransform\");\n    if (t) t.offsetY = y;\n  }\n  setUiOffset(name, x, y) {\n    const e = this.findEntityByName(name);\n    if (e === void 0) return;\n    const t = this.getComponent(e, \"uiTransform\");\n    if (t) {\n      t.offsetX = x;\n      t.offsetY = y;\n    }\n  }\n  updateHud() {\n    const toolName = this.tool === \"hoe\" ? \"Hoe (1)\" : this.tool === \"seeds\" ? \"Seeds (2)\" : \"Can (3)\";\n    this.setLabel(\n      \"HUD-Status\",\n      this.clockText() + \"   |   Coins: \" + this.coins + \"c   |   Tool: \" + toolName + (this.tool === \"seeds\" ? \" [\" + this.seedType + \", Q to switch]\" : \"\")\n    );\n    this.setLabel(\n      \"HUD-Inv\",\n      \"Seeds: tomato \" + this.seeds.tomato + \", carrot \" + this.seeds.carrot + \"   |   Bag: tomato \" + this.bag.tomato + \", carrot \" + this.bag.carrot + \", fish \" + this.bag.fish + (this.quest === \"active\" ? \"   |   Quest: 3 tomatoes for Mira\" : \"\")\n    );\n    if (this.shopOpen || this.fishing) return;\n    const player = this.findEntityByName(\"Player\");\n    if (player === void 0) return;\n    const t = this.getComponent(player, \"transform\");\n    if (!t) return;\n    const px = t.x;\n    const py = t.y;\n    const near = (x, y, r) => Math.hypot(px - x, py - y) <= r;\n    let hint = \"\";\n    if (near(4, 2, 1.4)) hint = \"E \\u2014 Sleep until tomorrow (saves the game)\";\n    else if (near(2, -1, 1.5)) hint = \"E \\u2014 Open Mira's Stall (buy seeds, sell crops)\";\n    else if (near(-4, -2, 1.6)) hint = \"E \\u2014 Fish in the pond\";\n    else {\n      const mira = this.findEntityByName(\"Mira\");\n      if (mira !== void 0) {\n        const mt = this.getComponent(mira, \"transform\");\n        if (mt && near(mt.x, mt.y, 1.5)) {\n          hint = this.quest === \"none\" ? \"E \\u2014 Talk to Mira\" : this.quest === \"active\" ? \"E \\u2014 Talk to Mira (quest: 3 tomatoes)\" : \"E \\u2014 Talk to Mira\";\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    if (!hint) {\n      for (const plot of this.plots) {\n        if (Math.hypot(px - plot.x, py - plot.y) <= 1.4) {\n          if (plot.state === \"grass\") hint = \"E \\u2014 Till with the Hoe (press 1)\";\n          else if (plot.state === \"tilled\") hint = \"E \\u2014 Plant \" + this.seedType + \" seeds (press 2)\";\n          else if (plot.stage >= 2) hint = \"E \\u2014 Harvest the \" + plot.crop + \"!\";\n          else if (!plot.watered) hint = \"E \\u2014 Water the \" + plot.crop + \" (press 3)\";\n          else hint = \"Growing... stage \" + (plot.stage + 1) + \" of 3\";\n          break;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    if (!hint) {\n      hint = \"WASD / arrows or D-pad to walk  \\u2022  1/2/3 tools  \\u2022  E interact\" + (this.minutes >= DAY_START_MINUTES + DAY_MINUTES - 30 ? \"  \\u2022  It is late \\u2014 go to bed!\" : \"\");\n    }\n    this.setLabel(\"HUD-Hint\", hint);\n  }\n  showDialogue(text) {\n    this.setDialogueText(text);\n    this.dialogueTimer = 4;\n  }\n  setDialogueText(text) {\n    this.dialogueText = text;\n    this.setLabel(\"Dialogue-Text\", text);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Dialogue-Panel\", -140);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Dialogue-Text\", -128);\n  }\n  hideDialogue() {\n    this.dialogueTimer = 0;\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Dialogue-Panel\", this.uiHiddenY);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Dialogue-Text\", this.uiHiddenY);\n  }\n  showShopPanel(show) {\n    const y = show ? -88 : this.uiHiddenY;\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Shop-Btn-1\", y);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Shop-Btn-2\", y);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Shop-Btn-3\", y);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Shop-Btn-4\", y);\n  }\n  showFishingBar() {\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Fishing-Bg\", -320);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Fishing-Zone\", -320);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Fishing-Marker\", -322);\n    this.updateFishingBar();\n  }\n  hideFishingBar() {\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Fishing-Bg\", this.uiHiddenY);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Fishing-Zone\", this.uiHiddenY);\n    this.setUiOffsetY(\"Fishing-Marker\", this.uiHiddenY);\n  }\n  updateFishingBar() {\n    const x = -150 + this.fishMarker * 300 - 6;\n    this.setUiOffset(\"Fishing-Marker\", x, -322);\n  }\n  playClick() {\n    try {\n      if (this.audio && typeof this.audio.playSound === \"function\") {\n        this.audio.playSound(\"ui-click\");\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n    }\n  }\n}\nvar GameManager_default = GameManager;\n"
      }
     }
